  "necessity": {
    "required": true,
    "reason": "The vendored editor sets tinyMCE.baseURL to the tinymce_editor mod and tinyMCE.suffix to .min, then initializes theme silver. The 5.10.7 loader requests themes/<theme>/theme.min.js before editor init, icons/default/icons.min.js, skins/ui/oxide/skin.min.css, skins/ui/oxide/content.min.css, and plugins/<name>/plugin.min.js. Those compiled files are absent from fixtures and from the pinned source tree. The pinned tree also has no installed dompurify 2.3.8 and no installed external @ephox build packages, so producing the compiled assets locally would require an install and upstream build scripts. This review did not run that build.",
    "evidence": [
      "fixtures/vendor/mod-script-assets/card-mod-tinymce_editor/assets/script/tinymce_config.js.coffee sets theme silver, plugins autoresize, mobile.theme mobile, baseURL mod/tinymce_editor, suffix .min",
      "third-party-source/tinymce-5.10.7/upstream/modules/tinymce/src/core/main/ts/init/Render.ts loads themes/<theme>/theme.min.js, icons/<name>/icons.min.js, and plugins/<name>/plugin.min.js",
      "third-party-source/tinymce-5.10.7/upstream/modules/tinymce/src/themes/silver/main/ts/ui/skin/Loader.ts requests skins/ui/<skin>/skin.min.css and content.min.css; default skin is oxide",
      "third-party-source/tinymce-5.10.7/upstream/modules/tinymce/src/themes/mobile/main/ts/util/CssUrls.ts requests skins/ui/oxide/content.mobile.min.css and skin.mobile.min.css",
      "skins/ui/oxide/skin.mobile.min.css references fonts/tinymce-mobile.woff in the same oxide directory",
      "No theme.min.js or oxide skin.min.css exists under third-party-source/tinymce-5.10.7",
      "modules/tinymce/package.json depends on dompurify 2.3.8; node_modules/dompurify is not in the pinned tree. yarn.lock also records external @ephox/bedrock-*, @ephox/oxide-icons-tools, @ephox/swag, and @ephox/wrap-* packages that are not workspace modules."
    ]
  },
