    "residualRisk": "Approval covers custody of the matching 5.10.7 compiled assets. It does not mean 5.10.7 is free of known vulnerabilities. The listed issues are in the core already redistributed as script_tinymce.js, which this archive matches byte for byte. Refusing the theme, icons, skin, and plugins would leave that core in place and keep the editor from initializing. 5.10.8 and 5.10.9 are public LGPL-2.1 builds and were not downloaded; they are different binaries and still do not clear the 2026 high advisories. 5.11.0 and 5.11.1 are not on registry.npmjs.org. The public 5-latest dist-tag is 5.10.9.",
    "defaultConfigExposure": "The shipped init loads autoresize plus the in-repo nest plugin. It does not load the media plugin named by GHSA-vg35-5wq7-3x7w. Vendoring standard plugins makes them available; it does not enable them."
